### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/


### ==========================================
### URL TEST WITHOUT AUTHENTICATION
### ==========================================

### Get all contacts (should not work)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts


### ==========================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ==========================================

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "mySuperPassword"
}

### Login and get token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "mySuperPassword"
}


### ==========================================
### CONTACTS (PROTECTED ROUTES)
### ==========================================

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Add a new contact
# @name createContact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
    "name": "james",
    "age": 20
}

### Get contact by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/{{createContact.response.body.data._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Update contact by ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/{{createContact.response.body.data._id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
    "name": "james updated",
    "age": 31
}

### Delete contact by ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/{{createContact.response.body.data._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}